# Test fixtures are byte-faithful captures of live Transfermarkt pages, CRLF and all.
# `-text` disables newline conversion in both directions, so a checkout on Linux (CI) and
# one on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) read the exact bytes the parsers were verified
# against. Without this the fixtures silently differ per platform, which is the one thing
# a fixture must never do.
tests/fixtures/*.html -text
